# Ringkasan

Dokumen ini menyajikan Sequence Diagram sederhana untuk tiga peran (User, Mitra/Partner, Admin) pada Event Organizer System. Setiap diagram menggunakan urutan peserta dari kiri ke kanan: Aktor, Frontend (Web/Mobile), Backend API Gateway, layanan internal (AuthService, CatalogService, OrderService, PaymentService, ReviewService, ChatService, ModerationService, NotificationService, PayoutService, AnalyticsService), Basis Data, dan layanan eksternal (Midtrans, RajaOngkir). Diagram menggunakan autonumber, activation/deactivation, serta blok alt/else dan opt untuk alur sukses/gagal yang ringkas.

## Role: User

### Skenario: Autentikasi — Login/Register Sederhana

Tujuan: Pengguna melakukan login atau registrasi; bila registrasi, sistem mengirim verifikasi email/OTP; akhir skenario adalah berhasil login atau muncul pesan kesalahan.

```plantuml
@startuml
autonumber
participant "User" as User
participant "Frontend (Web/Mobile)" as FE
participant "Backend API Gateway" as API
participant "Layanan Autentikasi (AuthService)" as Auth
participant "Layanan Notifikasi (NotificationService)" as Notif
database "Basis Data" as DB

User -> FE: Isi data login / registrasi
activate FE
FE -> API: POST /auth (login/registrasi)
activate API
API -> Auth: validasi input + proses daftar/masuk
activate Auth
note right of Auth
 - Validasi input & hashing sandi
 - Cek duplikasi email saat registrasi
end note
Auth -> DB: SELECT/INSERT pengguna
activate DB
DB --> Auth: data pengguna / dibuat
deactivate DB
alt Registrasi
  Auth -> Notif: kirimEmailVerifikasi()
  activate Notif
  Notif --> User: Email verifikasi terkirim
  deactivate Notif
  Auth --> API: status menunggu verifikasi
else Login
  Auth --> API: sesi/token dibuat
end
deactivate Auth
API -> FE: 200 OK / 401 Tidak Berwenang
deactivate API
FE --> User: Tampilkan hasil (dashboard / galat)
deactivate FE
@enduml
```

### Skenario: Order & Pembayaran — Checkout Sederhana (Validasi Stok, Ongkir, Midtrans)

Tujuan: Pengguna checkout; sistem validasi stok, menghitung ongkir via RajaOngkir, melakukan pembayaran via Midtrans; sukses: order terbayar dan notifikasi; gagal: pesan kegagalan.

```plantuml
@startuml
autonumber
participant "User" as User
participant "Frontend (Web/Mobile)" as FE
participant "Backend API Gateway" as API
participant "Layanan Pemesanan (OrderService)" as Order
participant "Layanan Pembayaran (PaymentService)" as Payment
participant "Layanan Notifikasi (NotificationService)" as Notif
database "Basis Data" as DB
participant "RajaOngkir (API Pengiriman)" as RO
participant "Midtrans (Gerbang Pembayaran)" as Midtrans

User -> FE: Klik Checkout
activate FE
FE -> API: POST /checkout/validate
activate API
API -> Order: validasiStok()
activate Order
Order -> DB: cek ketersediaan stok/slot
activate DB
DB --> Order: cukup / tidak cukup
deactivate DB
alt Stok cukup
  Order --> API: valid
  API -> RO: GET /cost (hitung ongkir)
  RO --> API: ongkir / galat
  alt Ongkir berhasil
    API -> Payment: buatSnapToken(orderId)
    activate Payment
    Payment -> DB: catat percobaan pembayaran
    activate DB
    DB --> Payment: tersimpan
    deactivate DB
    Payment --> API: snapToken
    deactivate Payment
    API -> FE: 200 OK (snapToken)
    deactivate API
    FE --> User: Jalankan SDK/pengalihan Midtrans
    alt Pembayaran sukses
      Midtrans --> API: webhook callback
      activate API
      note right of API
        Validasi tanda tangan (signature) & idempoten
      end note
      API -> Payment: tandaiLunas()
      activate Payment
      Payment -> DB: perbarui status bayar + order
      activate DB
      DB --> Payment: diperbarui
      deactivate DB
      par Notifikasi paralel
        Payment -> Notif: beriTahuPengguna(order dibayar)
        activate Notif
        Notif --> FE: Notifikasi dikirim (push) ke User
        deactivate Notif
      |||
        Payment -> Notif: beriTahuMitra(order dibayar)
        activate Notif
        Notif --> FE: Notifikasi dikirim (push) ke Mitra
        deactivate Notif
      end
      deactivate Payment
      API --> Midtrans: 200 OK
      deactivate API
    else Pembayaran gagal/kedaluwarsa
      Midtrans --> API: webhook status=gagal/kedaluwarsa
      activate API
      API -> Payment: tandaiGagal()
      activate Payment
      Payment -> DB: perbarui status gagal
      activate DB
      DB --> Payment: diperbarui
      deactivate DB
      Payment -> Notif: beriTahuPenggunaGagal()
      activate Notif
      Notif --> FE: Notifikasi gagal pembayaran
      deactivate Notif
      deactivate Payment
      API --> Midtrans: 200 OK
      deactivate API
    end
  else Ongkir gagal
    API -> FE: 502 Bad Gateway (coba ulang dengan jeda)
    deactivate API
  end
else Stok tidak cukup
  Order --> API: stok tidak cukup
  API -> FE: 409 Konflik
  deactivate API
end
deactivate FE
@enduml
```

## Role: Mitra/Partner

### Skenario: Pesanan & Pemenuhan — Konfirmasi/Tolak, Update Status, Bukti

Tujuan: Mitra menerima pesanan, memilih konfirmasi atau menolak, memperbarui status pemenuhan, dan mengunggah bukti; berakhir dengan status terbaru serta notifikasi.

```plantuml
@startuml
autonumber
participant "Mitra" as Mitra
participant "Frontend (Web/Mobile)" as FE
participant "Backend API Gateway" as API
participant "Layanan Pemesanan (OrderService)" as Order
participant "Layanan Notifikasi (NotificationService)" as Notif
database "Basis Data" as DB

Notif --> FE: Notifikasi pesanan baru
Mitra -> FE: Buka detail pesanan
activate FE
FE -> API: GET /dashboard/orders/{id}
activate API
API -> Order: ambilDetailPesanan()
activate Order
Order -> DB: SELECT order berdasarkan id
activate DB
DB --> Order: detail pesanan
deactivate DB
Order --> API: detail
deactivate Order
API -> FE: 200 OK
deactivate API

Mitra -> FE: Konfirmasi / Tolak
FE -> API: POST /orders/{id}/confirm|reject
activate API
API -> Order: konfirmasiAtauTolak()
activate Order
alt Konfirmasi
  Order -> DB: UPDATE status=confirmed
else Penolakan
  Order -> DB: UPDATE status=rejected + alasan
end
deactivate DB
Order --> API: diperbarui
deactivate Order
API -> FE: 200 OK
deactivate API

Mitra -> FE: Update status + unggah bukti
FE -> API: POST /orders/{id}/status + berkas
activate API
API -> Order: perbaruiPemenuhan()
activate Order
Order -> DB: UPDATE progres + referensi bukti
activate DB
DB --> Order: diperbarui
deactivate DB
Order --> API: ok
deactivate Order
API -> Notif: beriTahuPengguna()
activate Notif
Notif --> FE: Notifikasi ke User
deactivate Notif
API -> FE: 200 OK
deactivate API
deactivate FE
@enduml
```

### Skenario: Withdrawal — Ajukan Penarikan Sederhana

Tujuan: Mitra mengajukan penarikan; sistem menghitung saldo dan biaya/komisi, lalu menyetujui atau menolak dengan alasan dan mengirim notifikasi.

```plantuml
@startuml
autonumber
participant "Mitra" as Mitra
participant "Frontend (Web/Mobile)" as FE
participant "Backend API Gateway" as API
participant "Layanan Pencairan Dana (PayoutService)" as Payout
participant "Layanan Notifikasi (NotificationService)" as Notif
database "Basis Data" as DB

Mitra -> FE: Ajukan penarikan
activate FE
FE -> API: POST /payouts/request
activate API
API -> Payout: hitungDanAjukan()
activate Payout
Payout -> DB: hitung saldo tertahan - fee/komisi
activate DB
DB --> Payout: jumlah
deactivate DB
alt Valid & saldo cukup
  Payout -> DB: INSERT permintaan payout (pending)
  activate DB
  DB --> Payout: tersimpan
  deactivate DB
  Payout --> API: diantrikan untuk peninjauan
  API -> Notif: beriTahuMitraStatus()
  activate Notif
  Notif --> FE: Notifikasi status payout
  deactivate Notif
else Tidak valid / saldo kurang
  Payout --> API: tolak(alasan)
  API -> Notif: beriTahuKegagalan()
  activate Notif
  Notif --> FE: Notifikasi penolakan
  deactivate Notif
end
deactivate Payout
API -> FE: 200 OK / 400 Permintaan tidak valid
deactivate API
deactivate FE
@enduml
```

## Role: Admin

### Skenario: Moderasi — Approve/Reject Sederhana

Tujuan: Admin meninjau item pending (listing/review) dan memutuskan approve/reject dengan alasan; sistem mengirim notifikasi kepada pemilik.

```plantuml
@startuml
autonumber
participant "Admin" as Admin
participant "Frontend (Web/Mobile)" as FE
participant "Backend API Gateway" as API
participant "Layanan Moderasi (ModerationService)" as Mod
participant "Layanan Notifikasi (NotificationService)" as Notif
database "Basis Data" as DB
participant "Layanan Katalog (CatalogService)" as Catalog
participant "Layanan Ulasan (ReviewService)" as Review

Admin -> FE: Buka antrian moderasi
activate FE
FE -> API: GET /admin/moderations
activate API
API -> Mod: daftarPending()
activate Mod
Mod -> DB: SELECT item pending
activate DB
DB --> Mod: daftar item
deactivate DB
Mod --> API: daftar
deactivate Mod
API -> FE: 200 OK
deactivate API

Admin -> FE: Approve/Reject item
FE -> API: POST /admin/moderations/{id}/approve|reject
activate API
API -> Mod: putuskan(approve/reject, alasan)
activate Mod
alt Approve
  Mod -> DB: UPDATE status=published
else Reject
  Mod -> DB: UPDATE status=rejected + alasan
end
deactivate DB
Mod --> API: diperbarui
deactivate Mod
API -> Notif: beriTahuPemilik()
activate Notif
Notif --> FE: Notifikasi ke Mitra/User
deactivate Notif
API -> FE: 200 OK
deactivate API
deactivate FE
@enduml
```

### Skenario: Refund/Sengketa — Integrasi Midtrans Ringkas

Tujuan: Admin memproses refund/sengketa melalui Midtrans; sukses memperbarui status dan mengirim notifikasi, gagal mengembalikan alasan kesalahan.

```plantuml
@startuml
autonumber
participant "Admin" as Admin
participant "Frontend (Web/Mobile)" as FE
participant "Backend API Gateway" as API
participant "Layanan Pemesanan (OrderService)" as Order
participant "Layanan Pembayaran (PaymentService)" as Payment
participant "Layanan Notifikasi (NotificationService)" as Notif
database "Basis Data" as DB
participant "Midtrans (Gerbang Pembayaran)" as Midtrans

Admin -> FE: Ajukan refund/sengketa
activate FE
FE -> API: POST /admin/refund
activate API
API -> Order: validasiKelayakanRefund()
activate Order
Order -> DB: cek order & pembayaran
activate DB
DB --> Order: memenuhi syarat / tidak
deactivate DB
alt Memenuhi syarat
  Order --> API: ok
  API -> Payment: prosesRefund(jumlah, penuh/parsial)
  activate Payment
  Payment -> Midtrans: panggil API refund
  activate Midtrans
  Midtrans --> Payment: hasil sukses/gagal
  deactivate Midtrans
  alt Sukses
    Payment -> DB: UPDATE status refund
    activate DB
    DB --> Payment: diperbarui
    deactivate DB
    Payment -> Notif: beriTahuUserDanMitra()
    activate Notif
    Notif --> FE: Notifikasi status refund
    deactivate Notif
  else Gagal
    Payment --> API: rincian galat
  end
  deactivate Payment
else Tidak memenuhi syarat
  Order --> API: alasan penolakan
end
API -> FE: 200 OK / 400 Gagal
deactivate API
deactivate FE
@enduml
```
